OL,3,GNEWSAFormer PC admits indecent child
OL,4,Aimages charge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former West Yorkshire Police officer
OL,7,Fhas pleaded guilty to possessing
OL,8,Findecent images of children.
OL,10,FZachary Haile appeared at Leeds
OL,11,FMagistrates' Court earlier where he
OL,12,Fadmitted three counts of possessing
OL,13,Findecent photographs - including some
OL,14,FCategory A images showing the most
OL,15,Fsevere kinds of abuse.
OL,17,FThe 27-year-old, who was based in
OL,18,FLeeds, also pleaded guilty to one count
OL,19,Fof engaging in sexual communication
OL,20,Fwith a child.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
