OL,3,GNEWSAFormer PC admits indecent child
OL,4,Aimages charge
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe offences are alleged to have taken
OL,7,Fplace in Wakefield in 2022, when police
OL,8,Fsaid he was off-duty. Haile was ordered
OL,9,Fto appear before Leeds Crown Court to
OL,10,Fbe sentenced on 10 November.
